"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"To meet GBW\u22652\u202fMHz with CL=2\u202fpF, gm1\u224825\u202f\u00b5S is needed. With Itail\u22484.5\u202f\u00b5A (power \u226430\u202f\u00b5W) each input transistor carries \u22482.3\u202f\u00b5A, giving Vov\u22480.18\u202fV and W/L\u22480.7. Choosing L\u22480.7\u202f\u00b5m yields W\u22480.5\u202f\u00b5m for M1/M2. For similar output resistance (\u22655\u202fM\u03a9) and gain \u226542\u202fdB, longer channel devices (L\u22480.7\u202f\u00b5m) are used for the PMOS load, giving W\u22480.8\u202f\u00b5m. The tail NMOS (M5) supplies Itail\u22484.5\u202f\u00b5A, sized with Vov\u22480.2\u202fV, L\u22480.5\u202f\u00b5m, W\u22480.56\u202f\u00b5m. These sizes give the required gain, phase margin, slew rate, and output swing while staying within the power budget.\",\n  \"W1_um\": 0.5,\n  \"L1_um\": 0.7,\n  \"W3_um\": 0.8,\n  \"L3_um\": 0.7,\n  \"W5_um\": 0.56,\n  \"L5_um\": 0.5,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 4.5\n}"